    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“You breathe what kills them.”</em></p><p><strong>Toxic Lung Filters.</strong> You have advantage on defense checks against inhaled toxins, smoke, and industrial residue. You can function for up to 1 hour in atmospheres that would hospitalize a normal Medium creature.</p><p><strong>Scavenger's Eye (1/Short Rest; recharges on Soma Break).</strong> Spend 10 minutes in a ruin, junkyard, or wreckage site. You find one specific reasonable item that an attentive scavenger could plausibly have located there. The GM may gate exotic items behind a Mind (Investigation) check.</p>",
